(F,"Titanium grade 5 (Ti-6Al-4V), machined from bar (architecture 17.29). Reason:","Titanium grade 5 (Ti-6Al-4V), bar to ASTM B348, machined from bar in one piece (architecture 17.29; "+LD+"'item 99'). The builder asks for the bar certificate and checks it: tensile strength at least 895 MPa, 0.2 percent proof at least 828 MPa, elongation at least 10 percent. Reason:",LD+"'item 99' 2026-11-13 03:56"),
(F,"Default, to confirm with the maker: CNC machining from bar (multi-axis), one piece. Whether one piece can be machined, or the band must be turned and the block milled and joined, is open point 1 (architecture S13).","Fixed (item 99): CNC machining from bar (multi-axis), one piece, general tolerance ISO 2768-m. Whether a maker can machine it as one piece, or the band must be turned and the block milled and joined, is still asked of the maker: open point 1 (architecture S13).",LD+"'item 99' 2026-11-13 03:56"),
(F,"The body is polished, then coated gloss black (PVD or DLC; the maker names the process). The glass seat and the microphone seats are masked or finished after coating: open point 4. Coating thickness and Ra: open point 4.","The body is polished, then coated gloss black with Oerlikon Balzers BALINIT DLC: black, 1 to 3 um thick, applied under 250 degrees C; it adds at most 0.003 mm per face, which the 0.10 mm bond gap of the joystick frame takes. The maker's brochure lists titanium alloys as coatable but its table does not show for which coating: colour, gloss and adhesion are checked on the first coated body (item 105). The bond faces are abraded and cleaned with isopropyl alcohol before bonding (item 106); the glass seat and the microphone seats are masked or finished after coating: open point 4. Roughness Ra: open point 4.",LD+"'item 105' and 'item 106' 2026-11-13"),
(F,"Reason: the screen leaves 0.15 mm or less of clearance and the corner metal is thin.","Reason: the screen leaves 0.05 mm of clearance per side (as modelled; items 96 to 98) and the corner metal is thin.",LD+"'items 96, 97, 98' 2026-11-13 03:56"),
(F,"| board thickness seated in the cavity | 0.30 mm | open point 5 | block stack 17.2 (the board is its own part, specs/main-board.md) |","| board thickness seated in the cavity | 0.30 mm | start value, the model's value (items 96 to 98) | block stack 17.2 (the board is its own part, specs/main-board.md: the 4-layer microvia board of ring-board-plan.md section c.2, not a standard 0.4 mm board) |",LD+"'items 96, 97, 98'"),
(F,"| foam pad thickness above the board | 0.10 mm | open point 5 | block stack 17.2 |","| foam pad thickness above the board | 0.10 mm | start value, the model's value (items 96 to 98) | block stack 17.2; Nitto SCF AN010, 0.10 mm, no adhesive, held by the screen's pressure (item 96, rest) |",LD+"'item 96, rest (screen stack)' 04:15"),
(F,"| clear adhesive thickness under the glass | 0.10 mm | open point 5 | block stack 17.2 |","| clear adhesive thickness under the glass | 0.10 mm | start value, the model's value (items 96 to 98) | block stack 17.2; tesa 69404, optically clear, 100 um (item 96, rest) |",LD+"'item 96, rest (screen stack)' 04:15"),
(F,"| band stack inside the shell: liner | 0.3 mm | open point 5 | radial, band channel (specs/band-liner.md) |","| band stack inside the shell: liner | 0.3 mm | start value, the model's value (items 96 to 98) | radial, band channel (specs/band-liner.md; resin Master Bond EP30Med) |",LD+"'items 96, 97, 98'; 'liner resin'"),
(F,"| joystick stack: flex | 0.11 mm | open point 5 |","| joystick stack: flex | 0.11 mm | start value, the model's value (items 96 to 98) |",LD+"'items 96, 97, 98'"),
(F,"| screen panel, length | 27.35 mm | the pocket takes ISO 2768-f | pocket is larger than the panel; clearance is open point 2 |","| screen panel, length | 27.35 mm | the pocket takes ISO 2768-f | pocket is larger than the panel by 0.05 mm per side (27.45; open point 2, decided) |",LD+"'items 96, 97, 98'"),
